{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04940","headline":"慈恩寺九日应制 · 薛稷","name":"慈恩寺九日应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宝宫星宿劫，香塔鬼神功。\n王游盛尘外，睿览出区中。\n日宇开初景，天词掩大风。\n微臣谢时菊，薄采入芳丛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛稷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04940.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04940","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}